The newer .ltk atlas maps ("IMAA": hashes, no paths) and layouts whose
TextureName is a file hash (a WadChunkLink): the sprites keyed
"#<xxh64>", the atlases named uiautoatlas/<the .ltk without .ltk>/atlas_<n>.tex
(checked against their hash; all 240 .ltk of UI.wad in the 2026 data).
Without it every .ltk failed ("autoatlas: zla liczba atlasow") and the HUD
panels had no background (2026-11-15). Not only PeOS: these are the data.

